<title>INDIA: India's NALCO to meet for 96/97 results.</title>
<headline>India's NALCO to meet for 96/97 results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's National Aluminium Company Ltd (NALCO) said on Monday its board would meet to finalise financial results for 1996/97 (April-March) on April 22.</p>
<p>The results would be unaudited, the country's largest aluminium maker said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
